# insert-assistant

## Getting the Text to Display as a Cue for the Action

Use getCueText() to get the text that is displayed as a cue for the action.

Cues are shown in a tooltip when the user hovers over a button that is associated with the action. They are also included in the shortcut details shown when users press Shift+Ctrl+?.

This event is fired when the user presses a keyboard shortcut that is registered with insert-assistant.

The action that fires this event is in the Actions section of the Insert panel.

A keyboard shortcut can be registered for the action with the ShortcutManager.

### getCueText()
Gets the text to be displayed as a cue for the action.
