public String getCueText ()

# insert-button

## Getting a Button for the Action

Use getButton() to get a Button containing a description of the action.

You can use the button to display the action in a menu, or provide it as an alternative way for the user to trigger the action.

This event is fired when the user presses a keyboard shortcut that is registered with insert-button.

The action that fires this event is in the Actions section of the Insert panel.

A keyboard shortcut can be registered for the action with the ShortcutManager.

### getButton()
Gets a Button containing a description of the action.
