public Tooltip getToolTip ()

## Getting a Checkbox for the Action

Use getCheckbox() to get a Checkbox containing a description of the action.

You can use the checkbox to allow the user to enable or disable the action.

This event is fired when the user presses a keyboard shortcut that is registered with insert-checkbox.

The action that fires this event is in the Settings menu.

A keyboard shortcut can be registered for the action with the ShortcutManager.

