## Getting a List of All Checklist Issues

Use getChecklistIssues() to get a list of all issues that are included in the Checklist.

The Checklist includes issues for actions that are configured either with the insert-checklist or insert-checklist-action events.

This event is fired when the user presses a keyboard shortcut that is registered with insert-checklist.

